{"version": 1, "expected": 200, "ready": 200, "clips": [{"id": "jarvix_ru_01", "language": "ru", "text": "Привет! Я JARVIS, персональный ассистент Deepsyq. Умею открывать страницы, генерировать изображения и видео, а также помогать с проектами.", "sha256": "4f6c7952eb6c9408c5a55af7555190a6a7d968b9e08e826aff608a12ad007741", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_01.mp3?v=4f6c7952eb6c"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_02", "language": "ru", "text": "Здравствуйте! Все системы платформы работают в штатном режиме. Готов к работе.", "sha256": "b76b8e1944ed4ceb4b10b2f8359019ced47686096a93ac437847ca0eec3a089f", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_02.mp3?v=b76b8e1944ed"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_03", "language": "ru", "text": "Я на связи. Чем могу помочь прямо сейчас?", "sha256": "87d382855e79ae9da965247e3448451bcc8e8aed8e86a080c6e7eb27fb5b1b2e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_03.mp3?v=87d382855e79"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_04", "language": "ru", "text": "Рад снова вас слышать. Продолжаем работу над проектом?", "sha256": "23d15086722839f1fa273725d34b49af036396773ab70ad14a5cbcc497984652", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_04.mp3?v=23d150867228"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_05", "language": "ru", "text": "Системы активны. Какую задачу решаем?", "sha256": "c633e9a2dbe76522af22b6ae99f3bac90375dc7831ed57786e33360719416f73", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_05.mp3?v=c633e9a2dbe7"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_06", "language": "ru", "text": "Секунду, выполняю.", "sha256": "021a7ab151b187ba2936967fd72e14bf014dabbde1974f95b4048493a68081aa", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_06.mp3?v=021a7ab151b1"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_07", "language": "ru", "text": "Принято, уже делаю.", "sha256": "de5a90a99eadd0e94f0e53e04b9269e183e82697900b718283577b6f1243c7d4", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_07.mp3?v=de5a90a99ead"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_08", "language": "ru", "text": "Команда распознана.", "sha256": "d3158a9da9374f9a344a3b88e9eafb7436e2d5ff6aab02c3dc305efff85e890d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_08.mp3?v=d3158a9da937"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_09", "language": "ru", "text": "Сейчас всё подготовлю.", "sha256": "3d68aa10a34e828ed3400f2f0b31cbfa40dc4fd4da671fd8164565738be090bc", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_09.mp3?v=3d68aa10a34e"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_10", "language": "ru", "text": "Один момент, обрабатываю запрос.", "sha256": "ed1d23d2e9afce5c1cc26a62035a6a5ee173fb3cda1e539eb87b7d4618cc9601", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_10.mp3?v=ed1d23d2e9af"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_11", "language": "ru", "text": "Открываю Студию генерации.", "sha256": "a874f09a6125398029eaa9877bcea72bc1874592c938ef54980aaeee11d53cd0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_11.mp3?v=a874f09a6125"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_12", "language": "ru", "text": "Переходим в раздел тарифов и подписок.", "sha256": "b3bda78febfc6b2dda4549518c08abaddbfe362cc06c98e45d88f569df72678e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_12.mp3?v=b3bda78febfc"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_13", "language": "ru", "text": "Возвращаемся на главную страницу.", "sha256": "a34f6bcd7de2a66eb79a67500adb341805e5fa64a273eb083a20a926867e73f0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_13.mp3?v=a34f6bcd7de2"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_14", "language": "ru", "text": "Открываю галерею вдохновения.", "sha256": "f25a3d5c422c20b5e5075111c93345853e7e2a4d0913a5051a51cbb9a3d4f40d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_14.mp3?v=f25a3d5c422c"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_15", "language": "ru", "text": "Переключаю в каталог повседневных инструментов.", "sha256": "4b4be0796ae692a6b9094168838ffc0b22b46096ddc8d7481b17e5ab22963c58", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_15.mp3?v=4b4be0796ae6"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_16", "language": "ru", "text": "Запускаю генерацию изображения.", "sha256": "6aa369a2dd54d6886c7bf2c22bd02f5a441f324c8926ca04117831ebce9c69c4", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_16.mp3?v=6aa369a2dd54"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_17", "language": "ru", "text": "Рендеринг видео начался, это займет немного времени.", "sha256": "c92f14e3d6356b17ea5622ddda7f91bf2845b76592a1902ca0c676d552b86b5d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_17.mp3?v=c92f14e3d635"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_18", "language": "ru", "text": "Генерация завершена. Показываю результат на экране.", "sha256": "6bebaa3413b46b6e0cc3ab977d22d5389d7e5c102dd6f55ec0ba27e3bb79a9fd", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_18.mp3?v=6bebaa3413b4"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_19", "language": "ru", "text": "Отличная идея! Подбираю оптимальную нейросеть.", "sha256": "2a1c3d51ce351d3a7b73dc4ca045a4ae4f28ec891a722b2bb592a3cf101310b0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_19.mp3?v=2a1c3d51ce35"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_20", "language": "ru", "text": "Ваш проект успешно сохранен.", "sha256": "92240c7bbf53de3819391e076998d0629b95e96b570b5222f2f740344ff5cb72", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_20.mp3?v=92240c7bbf53"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_21", "language": "ru", "text": "Пожалуйста, уточните ваш запрос или добавьте подробностей.", "sha256": "ac3f52c70e47768050417c1eb8158e13041dd665fc016fffa59e740db2faaee2", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_21.mp3?v=ac3f52c70e47"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_22", "language": "ru", "text": "Не совсем понял команду. Повторите, пожалуйста.", "sha256": "1c9827ff779881217b7825ddb3a4b1e2606e8a481c6d35711d77834a5cf43502", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_22.mp3?v=1c9827ff7798"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_23", "language": "ru", "text": "Дневной лимит тестов обновлен.", "sha256": "3ac9f3f4a4908a188c4cedb131e5e675cea8f3e31ed90665dc8a6bbfee35952d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_23.mp3?v=3ac9f3f4a490"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_24", "language": "ru", "text": "Чем еще я могу быть полезен?", "sha256": "eef41ae9765bf2b97dc25e1a1a7b1370a6c5d317346f4405e022f2943ca973bd", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_24.mp3?v=eef41ae9765b"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_25", "language": "ru", "text": "Всегда к вашим услугам. Обращайтесь в любой момент!", "sha256": "faf98ff60986984abd6bfd4809c55f54bb6c67b52d771ddb92d8e67fa8df0fc4", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_25.mp3?v=faf98ff60986"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_26", "language": "ru", "text": "Открываю видеоплеер.", "sha256": "e1877f36674f9dc76a2f057a980cb727692d4fb9f4afb9878c4ec5cbe762140c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_26.mp3?v=e1877f36674f"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_27", "language": "ru", "text": "Открываю фотографию в полном размере.", "sha256": "2734a123f28669ad585e429da2217b76e11fba4c83a130e9ccf596d5db9abf80", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_27.mp3?v=2734a123f286"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_28", "language": "ru", "text": "Воспроизвожу аудиодорожку.", "sha256": "ff57c8b22de870fdaa42b775f4676a3f0879b75d90de38406b6424702b67a156", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_28.mp3?v=ff57c8b22de8"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_29", "language": "ru", "text": "Скачиваю готовый файл на ваше устройство.", "sha256": "011c9e7848ef949874ab7ed8b9eaa5c07551c1ef8125e54d831795fa20dbb78e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_29.mp3?v=011c9e7848ef"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_30", "language": "ru", "text": "Улучшаю текстовый промпт для лучшего результата.", "sha256": "3b2f71e3e87a71edf7d46ce000bd8f77ce17cc68aa933e93576cc6125b2892ce", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_30.mp3?v=3b2f71e3e87a"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_31", "language": "ru", "text": "Меняю соотношение сторон на шестнадцать к девяти.", "sha256": "a1b17571acb260cb5488b6709a85b7e779fdb4ddbf15b51a48cd5f935c2d4456", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_31.mp3?v=a1b17571acb2"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_32", "language": "ru", "text": "Переключаю формат на девять к шестнадцати для смартфона.", "sha256": "03a3b080acbff8bd749f438dce4b86a0bd82494e2efdcd573bebc55dbb4d1172", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_32.mp3?v=03a3b080acbf"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_33", "language": "ru", "text": "Удаляю фон с изображения.", "sha256": "fa359334b91a07054e8214bc786274a48ff5ce46ec847290ef2395c88aebfe8d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_33.mp3?v=fa359334b91a"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_34", "language": "ru", "text": "Увеличиваю резкость и качество деталей.", "sha256": "fdb9f2bd4847ae3963a17ae1af3a10cb15abd1b987027428896449153c86d054", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_34.mp3?v=fdb9f2bd4847"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_35", "language": "ru", "text": "Хотите создать еще один вариант?", "sha256": "bc5c1756ba484bc9120070305e531bec30cd94feebca7ca49dcbdf7874129727", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_35.mp3?v=bc5c1756ba48"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_36", "language": "ru", "text": "Какой художественный стиль выберем: реализм, аниме или киберпанк?", "sha256": "f3d91b7cec01468a61204403260b38080d34c0cfd4ca91c09d746557447de595", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_36.mp3?v=f3d91b7cec01"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_37", "language": "ru", "text": "Слушаю вас очень внимательно.", "sha256": "76b03b421e4d7ba00bc88e2761134910a93e931bc5ec437b8814145bbe8ec97b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_37.mp3?v=76b03b421e4d"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_38", "language": "ru", "text": "Да, конечно, сейчас всё сделаем.", "sha256": "4c059bb70c0a056e73e7412b54f4ee9d699a26b6230ba8bac3507d281ffbe010", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_38.mp3?v=4c059bb70c0a"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_39", "language": "ru", "text": "Готово! Взгляните, как получилось.", "sha256": "c003418c9e0d6bfa80d3ff61db28549c84cdabc46c6755c0c7a7f6dc8efebf34", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_39.mp3?v=c003418c9e0d"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_40", "language": "ru", "text": "Применяю выбранный стиль к вашему проекту.", "sha256": "35d7ff00ff7838e1a33183be92265684f311d5cdcca0b615cbf6b315fc96edee", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_40.mp3?v=35d7ff00ff78"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_41", "language": "ru", "text": "Очищаю холст для новой идеи.", "sha256": "f7ce72a370ed641181b4cbb94e416511c0f3ee087c8ef3b60733c07838aa55d7", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_41.mp3?v=f7ce72a370ed"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_42", "language": "ru", "text": "Создаю новую фотографию по вашему описанию.", "sha256": "5fdd92a24a6e2510cd4c9866b1c3982096c466d6162a4a0120134a58a955e348", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_42.mp3?v=5fdd92a24a6e"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_43", "language": "ru", "text": "Создаю видеоролик с плавной анимацией.", "sha256": "05288a0ae0e7ba89f7fcd4e1309bc0288cf82a5f3870afad2ef144c9aaf155f9", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_43.mp3?v=05288a0ae0e7"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_44", "language": "ru", "text": "Синтезирую голос для озвучки.", "sha256": "b72a8b52f75d8944ddf778c840212bae237c9e8a14d1519b770b06455f47ebc0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_44.mp3?v=b72a8b52f75d"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_45", "language": "ru", "text": "Пишу музыкальный трек для вашего видео.", "sha256": "31b672a20b887db8fecb5affec26ec167abc701c4f088839da846cccc7f71ff7", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_45.mp3?v=31b672a20b88"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_46", "language": "ru", "text": "Бонусные кредиты успешно начислены на ваш баланс.", "sha256": "49cf4bb81d04ccc5bc34862bd69f8240887461b94c30a7b8c5ef191c93da4164", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_46.mp3?v=49cf4bb81d04"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_47", "language": "ru", "text": "Этот тариф открывает максимальную скорость и все нейросети платформы.", "sha256": "4fdafdf54742fde63802f454b7924a93d69f126285d4d93f39c4192776aa0880", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_47.mp3?v=4fdafdf54742"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_48", "language": "ru", "text": "Сохраняю изменения в вашей библиотеке.", "sha256": "3913e86321b7226a50ad25a185d63ee25c416fb147396a09ca518544a2d2ca51", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_48.mp3?v=3913e86321b7"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_49", "language": "ru", "text": "Подождите несколько секунд, идёт финализация файла.", "sha256": "6ad13252bf5823f8961a3b50fac67e19bb7915c3ae31cd9e0e64f5f8438d8732", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_49.mp3?v=6ad13252bf58"}, {"id": "jarvix_ru_50", "language": "ru", "text": "Отличная работа! Что создадим дальше?", "sha256": "b3b495e901e16f29bbe6be5bf6146cbc4391d27641e251a48fd8fd675a1d97ae", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_ru_50.mp3?v=b3b495e901e1"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_01", "language": "en", "text": "Hello! I am JARVIS, your Deepsyq assistant. I can navigate pages, generate images and videos, and assist with your creative projects.", "sha256": "e009e541b8741f5d1b494bb609c7c838cd6ec7cc9aa3d9d77a02a52a65b1a842", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_01.mp3?v=e009e541b874"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_02", "language": "en", "text": "Greetings! All platform systems are nominal and ready for action.", "sha256": "34f6e169acc97820002dd013e80bf5a3f523a0b1c7a92a7475bedb5760bede83", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_02.mp3?v=34f6e169acc9"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_03", "language": "en", "text": "I am online. How can I assist you right now?", "sha256": "1ada203e8d4d0d0ea26882aa20b3a36cf732c02477afed9f2f44d0c46729f5a6", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_03.mp3?v=1ada203e8d4d"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_04", "language": "en", "text": "Great to hear from you again. Shall we continue our work?", "sha256": "d89aaa1a94f06d26e6e94f4e318bc7b5406e30b1c69778d95781d384af32b99c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_04.mp3?v=d89aaa1a94f0"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_05", "language": "en", "text": "All systems operational. What are we building today?", "sha256": "ae26d9f7ad3f470c3ef85641e04f7536dbca4f3d09adad0fcbda740c474ea2d1", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_05.mp3?v=ae26d9f7ad3f"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_06", "language": "en", "text": "Right away. Working on it.", "sha256": "6fd261378e209402b8f346fa500a4e62ff939757ee34c4eac23fc8c7092b0e47", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_06.mp3?v=6fd261378e20"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_07", "language": "en", "text": "Understood, handling it now.", "sha256": "b6628ae05fda6ea9e44066bf93aa87c24704bf52cbefeb285b7b07050aad996e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_07.mp3?v=b6628ae05fda"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_08", "language": "en", "text": "Command recognized.", "sha256": "d8fe3cb3924a806ffb4f696b39ac14f9e5bed37df0bce8538332c1d41aa371e0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_08.mp3?v=d8fe3cb3924a"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_09", "language": "en", "text": "Preparing everything for you.", "sha256": "f12fc97500d5a2033cc5997db7d0947e8746bb5ad2c19429dfbdbf8a56064c5a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_09.mp3?v=f12fc97500d5"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_10", "language": "en", "text": "Just a moment, processing your request.", "sha256": "27861db9981354ce5ddbf5d82829c87063c661e68c46dbdbab8ecf479b2a2e2a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_10.mp3?v=27861db99813"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_11", "language": "en", "text": "Opening the Generation Studio.", "sha256": "893e88780f0764f824904e4328f2589cc6ea2c8fa0c908524602a86cf9b9ce4f", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_11.mp3?v=893e88780f07"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_12", "language": "en", "text": "Navigating to plans and subscriptions.", "sha256": "3bf8e2025a450a5dd64cc7a812608698747e3a4b6627d9597b91845d0ba86b06", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_12.mp3?v=3bf8e2025a45"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_13", "language": "en", "text": "Returning to the homepage.", "sha256": "2ebd3e1adb10c8701ff7c0038fe6a260baec2ae74c8df7e2ab136c9727fc5ebb", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_13.mp3?v=2ebd3e1adb10"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_14", "language": "en", "text": "Opening the Inspiration showcase.", "sha256": "8e5fbb4b3749f0fc59e371a713e6df71b20d92c51ce9e24cd70ea41ecf14c7d3", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_14.mp3?v=8e5fbb4b3749"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_15", "language": "en", "text": "Switching to Everyday AI Tools.", "sha256": "3c23a019efc3f113584157fba077cc678e97c5f5fc5ddfc69e88dbe0403982e5", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_15.mp3?v=3c23a019efc3"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_16", "language": "en", "text": "Starting image generation now.", "sha256": "eda2955a5739cfc664fa073a135f7db89b9d0fbf7f00828c19ae31958d8f9d20", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_16.mp3?v=eda2955a5739"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_17", "language": "en", "text": "Video rendering has started, this will only take a moment.", "sha256": "5bd8679d78409d7cb4e05d728f6d47e22313655572ec5f225f43c265a1a55d3b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_17.mp3?v=5bd8679d7840"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_18", "language": "en", "text": "Generation complete. Displaying the result on your screen.", "sha256": "565c11606e6a983e076c166bfd43b7efd414acffbf9250c3c20d477ef01df5e8", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_18.mp3?v=565c11606e6a"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_19", "language": "en", "text": "Excellent concept! Selecting the optimal neural model.", "sha256": "8ff211aeb6fed8b67f82e7dbb8703b59eab96ce3e97938d57595c4a93429aced", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_19.mp3?v=8ff211aeb6fe"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_20", "language": "en", "text": "Your project has been successfully saved.", "sha256": "ae880809a1f5912d37ac6cf4a64426c6ed1798dfceb5f12e7dfbc145604941c8", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_20.mp3?v=ae880809a1f5"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_21", "language": "en", "text": "Could you please clarify your request with more detail?", "sha256": "460274ddf3c7f78e70fe67a2ca07c30151809fa2843c65c1a255789a6dcee4da", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_21.mp3?v=460274ddf3c7"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_22", "language": "en", "text": "I didn't quite catch that. Please say it once more.", "sha256": "e1a7c2900d5f5df5d4a66d0f78552df63cb4c144703f3aa8ebd65241f346f30e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_22.mp3?v=e1a7c2900d5f"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_23", "language": "en", "text": "Your daily test quota has been refreshed.", "sha256": "877e7ca0c52e50274a6bd87b2a85d66a40cc73adc88c2c627856771c147a4f2f", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_23.mp3?v=877e7ca0c52e"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_24", "language": "en", "text": "Is there anything else I can help you with?", "sha256": "f1d78a59671eeb5828e5d76eb502cbb5f0d489bcce8ff3a25cdbaed73a8433f9", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_24.mp3?v=f1d78a59671e"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_25", "language": "en", "text": "Always at your service. Call me anytime!", "sha256": "3d0533e7e2e0a1c356a264ba950744c1183bfe67b0d87789d8a8d10e5a5b5c7b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_25.mp3?v=3d0533e7e2e0"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_26", "language": "en", "text": "Opening the video player.", "sha256": "7c046cf4794daa6bb7ab4c23d0a3eaefa7b7390c7352544a23dc3996cbf6ef23", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_26.mp3?v=7c046cf4794d"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_27", "language": "en", "text": "Opening photo in full resolution.", "sha256": "e36a2a48cdb606c58e245c383329bf7b2f53342c6afcc631c4c44e8fcb34bb5c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_27.mp3?v=e36a2a48cdb6"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_28", "language": "en", "text": "Playing the audio track now.", "sha256": "e13d681083489eb2f92e396dfdd6c6055d42e2f7e9b35b6fdec1a50dd0597e81", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_28.mp3?v=e13d68108348"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_29", "language": "en", "text": "Downloading the finished file to your device.", "sha256": "9ce122831ba01bcc4dc6d40c2852a974ee9bef74c9cadf40bc607286316bae4a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_29.mp3?v=9ce122831ba0"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_30", "language": "en", "text": "Enhancing the prompt for best visual results.", "sha256": "75173d89704a91e5304d03e1a273fde5b6c5e659766e8041e469a3e52db98c21", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_30.mp3?v=75173d89704a"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_31", "language": "en", "text": "Switching aspect ratio to sixteen by nine widescreen.", "sha256": "360c3fe428573b78ab7468885f67f1263139c72a6bf5ab8ab48eba1f9d05ee17", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_31.mp3?v=360c3fe42857"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_32", "language": "en", "text": "Changing format to nine by sixteen mobile portrait.", "sha256": "66c84efe33a08ba36e465126818391de80656d81e76f7dada35b27d652ef08a8", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_32.mp3?v=66c84efe33a0"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_33", "language": "en", "text": "Removing the background from the image.", "sha256": "4c12eaf7716d86c7ad15f88414ef0c6dcce82ad27585fca5091b892824f43cfc", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_33.mp3?v=4c12eaf7716d"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_34", "language": "en", "text": "Upscaling details and sharpness.", "sha256": "c1d9218532fb21d826b2efa7e7b705f5a0a1eff9da0bdbc89c05346fa0c9cf32", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_34.mp3?v=c1d9218532fb"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_35", "language": "en", "text": "Would you like me to generate another variation?", "sha256": "3c7ffc3df3a38ee4f847b78517ed818a03a8745641b38a32980dcb98f7e61983", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_35.mp3?v=3c7ffc3df3a3"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_36", "language": "en", "text": "Which style would you prefer: photorealism, anime, or cyberpunk?", "sha256": "8f994b82e970d99bedaaf652a0396aa29267bb0905780ac8b91982211ea7a6a2", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_36.mp3?v=8f994b82e970"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_37", "language": "en", "text": "Listening closely. Go ahead.", "sha256": "153da48ac08fbc2dd90f17027b830da33dd75f5498a1a36cc10c086309845e47", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_37.mp3?v=153da48ac08f"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_38", "language": "en", "text": "Yes, absolutely, on it right now.", "sha256": "5e50fbdbbdec3a03208de90c1f374f97c7e5af79981ea13fe86d9c2ea9837a3d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_38.mp3?v=5e50fbdbbdec"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_39", "language": "en", "text": "Done! Take a look at how it turned out.", "sha256": "0fcbf43a3807cc7f75398dfeb861d9c18267a08b465c9140e10819426f027739", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_39.mp3?v=0fcbf43a3807"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_40", "language": "en", "text": "Applying the selected style to your project.", "sha256": "6fe11827ead4a21c4299ff83a4884548243982c4bf70aa0d2c0540a087e87fbe", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_40.mp3?v=6fe11827ead4"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_41", "language": "en", "text": "Clearing the canvas for a new creation.", "sha256": "ede5747dd78a3e954af068e09899599169dbda00133d469d302de738d49b9ad1", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_41.mp3?v=ede5747dd78a"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_42", "language": "en", "text": "Generating a new photo matching your description.", "sha256": "d4e2222682f7cb4685e19c314054c83e270953f5e3d89252118a03e7fcb03142", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_42.mp3?v=d4e2222682f7"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_43", "language": "en", "text": "Generating smooth video animation.", "sha256": "b35f6461b203bb36006dc68d70b503e38e21a980c24eeca5ec8bb7bc1701afc3", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_43.mp3?v=b35f6461b203"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_44", "language": "en", "text": "Synthesizing AI voiceover.", "sha256": "a688e16e635a6e9e7b46b2d7ef07996e12715a59522677b9e475cf2e0d6fedc8", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_44.mp3?v=a688e16e635a"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_45", "language": "en", "text": "Composing background music for your video.", "sha256": "c98bcf3a4f547b67ade86697233e8413e7a32488e1eee79677a0cdbed16daece", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_45.mp3?v=c98bcf3a4f54"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_46", "language": "en", "text": "Bonus credits have been added to your balance.", "sha256": "d11100d0654c111920e9080462c1111b0978025649a1ee6d0ad23eb20c180dc5", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_46.mp3?v=d11100d0654c"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_47", "language": "en", "text": "This plan unlocks maximum speed and all platform AI models.", "sha256": "799a70480b4819802e8b12982f995746346d0bc214fb819cbb245886edd6c8ad", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_47.mp3?v=799a70480b48"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_48", "language": "en", "text": "Saving changes to your creative library.", "sha256": "b307c1c84071d3aede8b10b2f35a2c5168d95026eb064f2f77bb1160baa38ddd", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_48.mp3?v=b307c1c84071"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_49", "language": "en", "text": "Please hold a moment, finalizing the export.", "sha256": "618c4dcbcc6c43244e3c695084815ec6dc5f433aaf11a66bef26fccd19175d3b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_49.mp3?v=618c4dcbcc6c"}, {"id": "jarvix_en_50", "language": "en", "text": "Great job! What should we build next?", "sha256": "816b95afd3e9b98c6ea54114e97bee636f40ceb589770dc2e0cdb7d4aa1f98d0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_en_50.mp3?v=816b95afd3e9"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_01", "language": "fr", "text": "Bonjour ! Je suis JARVIS, votre assistant Deepsyq. Je peux ouvrir vos pages, générer des images et vidéos, et vous aider sur vos projets.", "sha256": "a958e4127c2b2a286617042b8f125d3b9329705f2850deacb5206fd3d2c8ed81", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_01.mp3?v=a958e4127c2b"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_02", "language": "fr", "text": "Bonjour ! Tous les systèmes sont opérationnels et prêts à l'action.", "sha256": "7f93480091325491d598847b69ea54c9e6131c46b0e93624dd3c9ffe10d1c730", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_02.mp3?v=7f9348009132"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_03", "language": "fr", "text": "Je suis en ligne. Comment puis-je vous aider aujourd'hui ?", "sha256": "81ec6ec6cbe7badc74daa734c2ce598ef581d31f45df155a26cae2c7479bb5cc", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_03.mp3?v=81ec6ec6cbe7"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_04", "language": "fr", "text": "Ravi de vous retrouver. Continuons-nous notre travail ?", "sha256": "91c6efc705ed288ab16a19acc7c6d06230a710feebde268fe606e0a5e26e6024", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_04.mp3?v=91c6efc705ed"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_05", "language": "fr", "text": "Systèmes actifs. Quel est notre objectif du jour ?", "sha256": "2772d3cde8878c2ecf70ddf39658b938e7c2336a93e8bbe044e1605d6d1eb48f", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_05.mp3?v=2772d3cde887"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_06", "language": "fr", "text": "Un instant, je m'en occupe.", "sha256": "2a9e76392a6cd362cb556b7740c4712218f35518b737eddc0afc7590eca7021b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_06.mp3?v=2a9e76392a6c"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_07", "language": "fr", "text": "Bien reçu, c'est en cours.", "sha256": "6b39b9c2fd59e91185efb3bfb5e53aef97d35a62b598f44c3969c32c6692b6ad", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_07.mp3?v=6b39b9c2fd59"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_08", "language": "fr", "text": "Commande bien reconnue.", "sha256": "9b4107abf262714cc9b20631df50468dedf21cb614df7e3c88ba0081221b0c2a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_08.mp3?v=9b4107abf262"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_09", "language": "fr", "text": "Je prépare tout pour vous.", "sha256": "ab682a18de17b9657ea508a1c8cca106036ffdb60b3299d80f314651147d026c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_09.mp3?v=ab682a18de17"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_10", "language": "fr", "text": "Un moment, je traite votre demande.", "sha256": "1b2dd3308495fe0771675c9f160034746471268ade46c563ece8102afa4cd6d0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_10.mp3?v=1b2dd3308495"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_11", "language": "fr", "text": "Ouverture du Studio de génération.", "sha256": "3c71598b2a0ba17adaed873ca5da4c795be639b8d85de9ad0ea62b0b4e16c203", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_11.mp3?v=3c71598b2a0b"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_12", "language": "fr", "text": "Direction la page des tarifs et abonnements.", "sha256": "f391507b778f49d46b70eeb71602f9b028f60b3dd7448cf587101d3050fb7503", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_12.mp3?v=f391507b778f"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_13", "language": "fr", "text": "Retour à la page d'accueil.", "sha256": "33e26c5e783daee30501d1d19adac1e0d5c630e576366ba209b0265ef23026e3", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_13.mp3?v=33e26c5e783d"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_14", "language": "fr", "text": "Ouverture de la galerie d'inspiration.", "sha256": "81fd5308c9098affb91f08bc926938b89e8568e5e593b085d0fafe026c39856a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_14.mp3?v=81fd5308c909"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_15", "language": "fr", "text": "Bascule vers les outils IA du quotidien.", "sha256": "84539e28afa2fef6c1b1db8f2804d84b2eaaa616241f7db733971ee0cdc1e862", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_15.mp3?v=84539e28afa2"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_16", "language": "fr", "text": "Lancement de la génération d'image.", "sha256": "77c25b18264dcec3bb127734f946d76af6aab5c3db0d1c1cd3b8b940f856fc5d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_16.mp3?v=77c25b18264d"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_17", "language": "fr", "text": "Le rendu vidéo a débuté, cela ne prendra que quelques instants.", "sha256": "fc6538a8c0e982376142ef503fa6e39433c36cf12e156d6315b38cc6f13e4920", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_17.mp3?v=fc6538a8c0e9"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_18", "language": "fr", "text": "Génération terminée. Voici votre résultat à l'écran.", "sha256": "e268caa67b850757903369302a7bd4943612017e9916c680dac9224115c5853b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_18.mp3?v=e268caa67b85"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_19", "language": "fr", "text": "Excellente idée ! Je sélectionne le meilleur modèle.", "sha256": "6846d3c9753d9c92762edcd539ba64ca119839dc7d29f6d715c41dc1f9e98330", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_19.mp3?v=6846d3c9753d"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_20", "language": "fr", "text": "Votre projet a été sauvegardé avec succès.", "sha256": "0ae72cfb3d1595278c000620accd7af8f83b6c8d061b9cc598192e29617ac5cc", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_20.mp3?v=0ae72cfb3d15"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_21", "language": "fr", "text": "Pourriez-vous préciser votre demande avec un peu plus de détails ?", "sha256": "41a538478ed49ba548941d14d0b7ed5e22f6ec86a19aff03621d3c454e8bae64", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_21.mp3?v=41a538478ed4"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_22", "language": "fr", "text": "Je n'ai pas bien compris. Pouvez-vous répéter, s'il vous plaît ?", "sha256": "dce8bffb621461131a54946cabafd0be385fb795457d57f072d80cfff4020d59", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_22.mp3?v=dce8bffb6214"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_23", "language": "fr", "text": "Votre quota de tests quotidiens a été actualisé.", "sha256": "6d8839c7482a306f4e7c73d0f4e0203f4575bb9e2d538ac55b89d5bd96b5f071", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_23.mp3?v=6d8839c7482a"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_24", "language": "fr", "text": "Y a-t-il autre chose que je puisse faire pour vous ?", "sha256": "356f93914bfc1cefcb0394f59a3bf876fc63b559d169d87ad3ee37bebda50837", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_24.mp3?v=356f93914bfc"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_25", "language": "fr", "text": "Toujours à votre service. N'hésitez pas !", "sha256": "03390d76ca414ef82621f48adb50c9f82c0dcfaaf23926064af52f4d809a99da", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_25.mp3?v=03390d76ca41"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_26", "language": "fr", "text": "Ouverture du lecteur vidéo.", "sha256": "afee98ca24ac084fb1fe8569c6cc5afd524054a261ecf63efd387a941325ce8b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_26.mp3?v=afee98ca24ac"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_27", "language": "fr", "text": "Affichage de la photo en haute résolution.", "sha256": "ac1b437ceadc80387ae3a2b0c837cb9b09d1b67f9c474039672b60875eeba3bf", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_27.mp3?v=ac1b437ceadc"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_28", "language": "fr", "text": "Lecture de la piste audio.", "sha256": "c5dfde7070049c56c7cbcbf3e61d57144cf00eb2967df0f1fe6b61e65fe27f0b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_28.mp3?v=c5dfde707004"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_29", "language": "fr", "text": "Téléchargement du fichier final sur votre appareil.", "sha256": "9ba4ad838d1ba05b0d9690724ed003e79cafd64cc69f7425a1502b9f6f0ef71f", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_29.mp3?v=9ba4ad838d1b"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_30", "language": "fr", "text": "Amélioration de votre prompt pour un résultat optimal.", "sha256": "3be9717fbd76a53bde1859555fdb2a030411fa587bc33f08c3fa8a0cd04c082a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_30.mp3?v=3be9717fbd76"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_31", "language": "fr", "text": "Format ajusté en seize neuvièmes panoramique.", "sha256": "7fbdca18f59f64e3c826d0b56197fa3d1157b753f4be06a2ec5b9b784c7f679d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_31.mp3?v=7fbdca18f59f"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_32", "language": "fr", "text": "Format ajusté en neuf seizièmes pour smartphone.", "sha256": "2ec633c0d425e937773c0b3d315ab861c08f4ba90827b970404ef50f6149b500", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_32.mp3?v=2ec633c0d425"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_33", "language": "fr", "text": "Suppression de l'arrière-plan de l'image.", "sha256": "04054f32e57b84f43c81101619bac644f4e9d54be6b550d51474fb1bb11df337", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_33.mp3?v=04054f32e57b"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_34", "language": "fr", "text": "Amélioration de la netteté et des détails.", "sha256": "276537a40cd06c0d72ee9f7ad8c1c928b0503ec833da7bc2ac8bcedaf9d9ceb3", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_34.mp3?v=276537a40cd0"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_35", "language": "fr", "text": "Souhaitez-vous générer une autre variation ?", "sha256": "1b32a8e84e7adb5d6975ef363f9aff8f82f5a77a511f00aa22c894ef8bbc3972", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_35.mp3?v=1b32a8e84e7a"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_36", "language": "fr", "text": "Quel style préférez-vous : réalisme, animé ou cyberpunk ?", "sha256": "c742557e10fa968f264ee5253c46e84b004d7e7534da559c1409637f456e60cb", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_36.mp3?v=c742557e10fa"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_37", "language": "fr", "text": "Je vous écoute très attentivement.", "sha256": "bf76174a47f50158e20d732d85346bee0be7708487e49a85c8667a9e86fd41f5", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_37.mp3?v=bf76174a47f5"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_38", "language": "fr", "text": "Oui, bien sûr, c'est parti.", "sha256": "fa20cead4841070f19c4a29135dcd9381a5a0115e9df3dc59e14c0fd7e786826", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_38.mp3?v=fa20cead4841"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_39", "language": "fr", "text": "C'est prêt ! Regardez le résultat.", "sha256": "c1a5ea5f281a514909ecd1fb8f5cf264c231d61f278741d2538b093beba19b6d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_39.mp3?v=c1a5ea5f281a"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_40", "language": "fr", "text": "Application du style sélectionné à votre projet.", "sha256": "9c0d55addf2d1ffe79381f0b1ea3d9e3525d269b0677b0f7394e4e73e9939a08", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_40.mp3?v=9c0d55addf2d"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_41", "language": "fr", "text": "Nettoyage du canevas pour une nouvelle création.", "sha256": "668f437f056f67915ab1a6c2b20950aa354eef1023c837739e7468b520b4dff7", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_41.mp3?v=668f437f056f"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_42", "language": "fr", "text": "Création d'une nouvelle photo selon votre description.", "sha256": "60191a5f1f70ab4ee33d2fab32c70621f0d2d3b1395957c0974dfa4360632a0e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_42.mp3?v=60191a5f1f70"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_43", "language": "fr", "text": "Création d'une vidéo avec animation fluide.", "sha256": "b6a499d6f244b27e7dd4a71eb98dd06a795f535c83b276c0d840ae83d1816694", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_43.mp3?v=b6a499d6f244"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_44", "language": "fr", "text": "Synthèse de la voix off par IA.", "sha256": "1a437d593ed2d486c49a7115994e5eaac56d265701cddea984fc8dc0b8474936", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_44.mp3?v=1a437d593ed2"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_45", "language": "fr", "text": "Composition d'une musique de fond pour votre vidéo.", "sha256": "f26100748f1066ab0195dc593afee600294ee9f6359599c84a8d760dd430092e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_45.mp3?v=f26100748f10"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_46", "language": "fr", "text": "Vos crédits bonus ont été ajoutés à votre solde.", "sha256": "0821a7ff2a9c9d6a2e0158573fdce50e86e0d5091d0c7519bd8070f9de457089", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_46.mp3?v=0821a7ff2a9c"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_47", "language": "fr", "text": "Ce forfait débloque la vitesse maximale et toutes les IA.", "sha256": "78984374a3f204d33143f136e3ae2a735c7f7dd240303006f2292ed9551a7109", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_47.mp3?v=78984374a3f2"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_48", "language": "fr", "text": "Enregistrement des modifications dans votre bibliothèque.", "sha256": "12f97393577f0d4a5208d149774289d5f8644175e0e63b60370c97b84dfd9f45", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_48.mp3?v=12f97393577f"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_49", "language": "fr", "text": "Quelques secondes d'attente, finalisation en cours.", "sha256": "ad1d2b7bab2d24e4e67ca3f94d2dac2a61cbbcab4eee324afe6d32c015ee156b", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_49.mp3?v=ad1d2b7bab2d"}, {"id": "jarvix_fr_50", "language": "fr", "text": "Superbe création ! Que faisons-nous ensuite ?", "sha256": "b7771c467b612f70a45513a56328b478e6a1ce699892febcfc327a9534608554", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_fr_50.mp3?v=b7771c467b61"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_01", "language": "es", "text": "¡Hola! Soy JARVIS, tu asistente de Deepsyq. Puedo navegar por páginas, generar imágenes y videos, y ayudarte en tus proyectos.", "sha256": "7537a50a6f630275b445d46f0244fd7b20245ed678703708d60bdb4ce5986038", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_01.mp3?v=7537a50a6f63"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_02", "language": "es", "text": "¡Saludos! Todos los sistemas funcionan con normalidad. Listo para trabajar.", "sha256": "ac7c2e513d1c1fe1455c890f755941d439c86bfb2ef3e5e46873497b7e7e32d7", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_02.mp3?v=ac7c2e513d1c"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_03", "language": "es", "text": "Estoy en línea. ¿En qué puedo ayudarte ahora mismo?", "sha256": "b96e9caee01f95309b7880ce7c6e7c81de5221ec68dbe64c126392d68962cee0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_03.mp3?v=b96e9caee01f"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_04", "language": "es", "text": "Me alegra escucharte de nuevo. ¿Continuamos con el proyecto?", "sha256": "b0616b6a07a3cd696560b17c161a847dff95afd60e92f3a98f4ff160a1b328eb", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_04.mp3?v=b0616b6a07a3"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_05", "language": "es", "text": "Sistemas activos. ¿Qué tarea resolvemos hoy?", "sha256": "c5fa959ab31631ffa77c7cb22236c359e773ec73ea6e593a623221f5a03a04a8", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_05.mp3?v=c5fa959ab316"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_06", "language": "es", "text": "Un segundo, lo hago de inmediato.", "sha256": "ebd3a01ab998e30eb3f528e6e022fdb777ffa739bfac63dfe680d8a3755fcd2f", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_06.mp3?v=ebd3a01ab998"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_07", "language": "es", "text": "Entendido, ya está en marcha.", "sha256": "4245ddf7a6b92b31ff0569c018209713b7dda4260104bb34dc0996f70c0ba486", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_07.mp3?v=4245ddf7a6b9"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_08", "language": "es", "text": "Comando reconocido.", "sha256": "595b0e891557a462034794588707a89454b36ad9e0ad40ce2a43f6b1ed62e7cb", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_08.mp3?v=595b0e891557"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_09", "language": "es", "text": "Preparando todo para ti.", "sha256": "35e13114de549374d381f56cdd955085d9e0bd5dedc8da3433b9a42c0f2878d4", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_09.mp3?v=35e13114de54"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_10", "language": "es", "text": "Un momento, procesando tu solicitud.", "sha256": "d1dcb601d480480d067824aab6667a9e6a29296299155763c55b6b94d0ecf891", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_10.mp3?v=d1dcb601d480"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_11", "language": "es", "text": "Abriendo el Estudio de generación.", "sha256": "658a5b7fc976e580e41453fede2c4107cbbf205fcfb5633daeb8cdc9620f1c2c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_11.mp3?v=658a5b7fc976"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_12", "language": "es", "text": "Vamos a la sección de planes y suscripciones.", "sha256": "f9425311cd516b12fff8d3d586e99122f12622ac3115fce4ddca4f67cc9e14a2", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_12.mp3?v=f9425311cd51"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_13", "language": "es", "text": "Volviendo a la página principal.", "sha256": "8724b4fbf5683f25954efe6901878bbddadcb36e6ba08ae8fcdff35123110176", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_13.mp3?v=8724b4fbf568"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_14", "language": "es", "text": "Abriendo la galería de inspiración.", "sha256": "f3c4d489743a51c850e7022182c4657a4731861dd843c2b110bb06dcf8402a2a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_14.mp3?v=f3c4d489743a"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_15", "language": "es", "text": "Cambiando a las herramientas de IA diarias.", "sha256": "b05f5c42c0a1b22a552f790906d2a0b55efe64b879036e8716f50b0566959aee", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_15.mp3?v=b05f5c42c0a1"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_16", "language": "es", "text": "Iniciando la generación de imagen ahora.", "sha256": "8f855227ade08564babc5459c6509ab899619c6348a8f7e1fc449a881ed8da3c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_16.mp3?v=8f855227ade0"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_17", "language": "es", "text": "El renderizado del video ha comenzado, tomará unos instantes.", "sha256": "2b9ae72a42646335ba4250905c7d55f5b9e7f72ccdc00d041a5b8d22d4f97109", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_17.mp3?v=2b9ae72a4264"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_18", "language": "es", "text": "Generación completada. Mostrando el resultado en pantalla.", "sha256": "1ec356e6c1ea492fb739b6ca4548995ded19b0e5ecc1b14ff0238cff8f414ab7", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_18.mp3?v=1ec356e6c1ea"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_19", "language": "es", "text": "¡Excelente idea! Seleccionando el modelo óptimo.", "sha256": "b2ace50497587700c72d482088296408933513e9b9a769a16fd0280893a34c12", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_19.mp3?v=b2ace5049758"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_20", "language": "es", "text": "Tu proyecto se ha guardado con éxito.", "sha256": "f8313d4b76e0059997364300b73a6a932c5628e90365b137c3ef3af098b1fd65", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_20.mp3?v=f8313d4b76e0"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_21", "language": "es", "text": "¿Podrías darme más detalles sobre tu solicitud?", "sha256": "9ced51cd109193f59337cb41724b87896ca355e7e43d5d098d0b170a1488b764", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_21.mp3?v=9ced51cd1091"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_22", "language": "es", "text": "No he entendido bien el comando. ¿Puedes repetirlo, por favor?", "sha256": "4054239b02068f3ddf762bd3a66ee3201e96f6ce9884bb7662eac571b0d75fb1", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_22.mp3?v=4054239b0206"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_23", "language": "es", "text": "Tu cuota diaria de pruebas se ha renovado.", "sha256": "2fe0660f41f46c6e06b5c98ef91e69ce0e98ce7e60777de180393214cae640f0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_23.mp3?v=2fe0660f41f4"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_24", "language": "es", "text": "¿Hay algo más en lo que pueda ayudarte?", "sha256": "73d7eb64c8118eedee99dfaff04d9c5468dd4bf07ac4da8e621e5cd4dda4967e", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_24.mp3?v=73d7eb64c811"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_25", "language": "es", "text": "Siempre a tu servicio. ¡Llámame cuando quieras!", "sha256": "4707e5f4a4eb33c57aa92f873b879ee5648502c09f2ef2eec6a1c78671912f78", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_25.mp3?v=4707e5f4a4eb"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_26", "language": "es", "text": "Abriendo el reproductor de video.", "sha256": "ebbba1696078cfd8685006321a9cc2e2b4b300ce3562cb4aa8bc6b40913e72a3", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_26.mp3?v=ebbba1696078"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_27", "language": "es", "text": "Mostrando la foto en alta resolución.", "sha256": "c6ece014467e7a7bb5db7e303e36df173823a5626e340f74c6272d7ae8cb13cd", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_27.mp3?v=c6ece014467e"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_28", "language": "es", "text": "Reproduciendo la pista de audio.", "sha256": "0e0526b5ae96be6488ad72a22aab169d1d35c6febc52fd97e3e3d2339d7ef5cb", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_28.mp3?v=0e0526b5ae96"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_29", "language": "es", "text": "Descargando el archivo listo en tu dispositivo.", "sha256": "e834d2a8a584a4daf074f2e37b14f1b7b3e67e1f7d2a98095b5644521bc85e89", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_29.mp3?v=e834d2a8a584"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_30", "language": "es", "text": "Mejorando el texto para lograr el mejor resultado.", "sha256": "351dbd894f5ab61096e641c7ae555f5a22aada47d404ec3707a1a0bbce2bedb4", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_30.mp3?v=351dbd894f5a"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_31", "language": "es", "text": "Cambiando proporción a dieciséis novenos panorámico.", "sha256": "e4bf7a78aa8d2e8f0c915e00192311e1b4181d154c7075eae20613546191950c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_31.mp3?v=e4bf7a78aa8d"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_32", "language": "es", "text": "Cambiando formato a nueve dieciseisavos vertical.", "sha256": "de222c9622b8bdccc43cd2ee8ab2ee8fdd5ce92e5ff31ef243380f8ba0ce9008", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_32.mp3?v=de222c9622b8"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_33", "language": "es", "text": "Eliminando el fondo de la imagen.", "sha256": "b408933d360d424b2deb4e208e4556e076e13039b57fa8aba5d8e51baec9aaf6", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_33.mp3?v=b408933d360d"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_34", "language": "es", "text": "Mejorando la nitidez y los detalles finos.", "sha256": "302fe896f627519ba9bbd73c9092351d82b50f165ad7418cb69cdb86ede871fc", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_34.mp3?v=302fe896f627"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_35", "language": "es", "text": "¿Deseas generar otra variación diferente?", "sha256": "b6aa694b26487f7b140c39ceb99941f401c739bc51ecc5e328104a1bbf71484c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_35.mp3?v=b6aa694b2648"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_36", "language": "es", "text": "¿Qué estilo prefieres: realismo, anime o ciberpunk?", "sha256": "1e0992d8e391b464c876ebf2169871abf31e6f9b145a133704f9e916c9c4f072", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_36.mp3?v=1e0992d8e391"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_37", "language": "es", "text": "Te escucho atentamente. Dime.", "sha256": "4c28b7e2a503e387a9bbb006083d1b3e3c925067c134dbec3df5581e84a542ef", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_37.mp3?v=4c28b7e2a503"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_38", "language": "es", "text": "Sí, por supuesto, manos a la obra.", "sha256": "8fbaf4bb039231aec1b8f8eda44dca2d86138513ef591ea83327d4d7cba0c851", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_38.mp3?v=8fbaf4bb0392"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_39", "language": "es", "text": "¡Listo! Mira cómo ha quedado.", "sha256": "594528405964f86f15d2840b2c7d9fa658cb50f33b99820e428276eaeeae7d1d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_39.mp3?v=594528405964"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_40", "language": "es", "text": "Aplicando el estilo seleccionado a tu proyecto.", "sha256": "945033bfa403cc62432d16cfcf49a11834af097e0d895184bea1eb6de56670da", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_40.mp3?v=945033bfa403"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_41", "language": "es", "text": "Limpiando el lienzo para una nueva idea.", "sha256": "254096f3cdbb43265470f877cc3e0e41dbab00cdfe2ce7ebf4c7f015f16d74ef", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_41.mp3?v=254096f3cdbb"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_42", "language": "es", "text": "Creando una nueva fotografía según tus indicaciones.", "sha256": "2d48cd2145207dc2da5c0dec9b68f460fd9ea77816267b233018df8644bd08ef", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_42.mp3?v=2d48cd214520"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_43", "language": "es", "text": "Creando un video con animación fluida.", "sha256": "27ab463206b1a4077fd80c343ea96aaf664ae34d5577994998f060804f8eb16c", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_43.mp3?v=27ab463206b1"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_44", "language": "es", "text": "Sintetizando la voz en off con inteligencia artificial.", "sha256": "01a7b6a47422a09a5218218b3246820472a6a4a46458cc15dd9e8cfa93e1454a", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_44.mp3?v=01a7b6a47422"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_45", "language": "es", "text": "Componiendo música de fondo para tu video.", "sha256": "d64837ed36f3118a8a87ab3a6b0c7169d790171a2bdc7004b285e6316dc45912", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_45.mp3?v=d64837ed36f3"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_46", "language": "es", "text": "Los créditos de bonificación se han añadido a tu cuenta.", "sha256": "98163b74235b3b4fc96cfeb06a0d82e25c1826c920a5c5aae415c936c26badef", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_46.mp3?v=98163b74235b"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_47", "language": "es", "text": "Este plan desbloquea máxima velocidad y todas las redes neuronales.", "sha256": "fc1d23b57d85e53f40f6fb91cfd8ffb78a012f1c01b3eb70e33957517260b7f0", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_47.mp3?v=fc1d23b57d85"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_48", "language": "es", "text": "Guardando los cambios en tu biblioteca.", "sha256": "e9347efd0a7e503e3f5160035b4b895aa2ac9cc3d1e296697b9fd6fabd079e75", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_48.mp3?v=e9347efd0a7e"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_49", "language": "es", "text": "Espera unos segundos, finalizando el archivo.", "sha256": "2b6994ed787d9c408f982761521c915277e4de52803fc2e04f08e3c2741afc23", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_49.mp3?v=2b6994ed787d"}, {"id": "jarvix_es_50", "language": "es", "text": "¡Excelente trabajo! ¿Qué creamos ahora?", "sha256": "1d7ad0c4ebc1b56d204625e59edc3a4a4958b8c155cef24a314e0dbb2e38237d", "url": "/media/jarvix/clips/jarvix_es_50.mp3?v=1d7ad0c4ebc1"}]}